ive_source_review","review":"content-review-021.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL19655889W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p413369099"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"f2d45278e7045e45208bae8b3c097717f2155d080438419ac235c9105c07b357","cover_id":14348677,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-003.json","limitation":"Front and source-edition binding; no barcode or exact-printing-year assertion."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL19655889W","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-003","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":924300125},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":987202004},"seq":23,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"paperback","work_id":987102003,"evidence":[{"note":"Exact Dutch ISBN9789000360475 matches A court of frost and starlight2018. Preserve novella identity, current Work and sequence links; no implicit full-length-volume classification.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p413369099"],"reference":"work:2175","checked_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00.000Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-021.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL19655889W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p413369099"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"f2d45278e7045e45208bae8b3c097717f2155d080438419ac235c9105c07b357","cover_id":14348677,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-003.json","limitation":"Front and source-edition binding; no barcode or exact-printing-year assertion."}],"cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/14348677-L.jpg?default=false","edition_id":987202004,"bound_title":"Hof van ijs en sterren","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789000360475","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p413369099","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-003","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/14348677-M.jpg?default=false","bound_author_id":924300125},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":987102008,"language":"nl"},"seq":24,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Artemis Fowl gebruikt gestolen elfentechnologie om een uitzonderlijk krachtige computer te bouwen. Wanneer een gevaarlijke Amerikaanse zakenman het apparaat in handen krijgt, wordt zijn uitvinding een probleem dat hij niet alleen kan oplossen. Hij moet samenwerken met bondgenoten én met de elfen wier kennis hij heeft benut. Hun poging de computer terug te krijgen vraagt om een plan waarin uiteenlopende belangen moeten passen. Dit deel draait om de gevolgen van Artemis'' eigen technische ambities en zijn noodgedwongen samenwerking met anderen.","work_id":987102008,"evidence":[{"note":"Exact Dutch ISBN9789047500469 matches Artemis Fowl The eternity code2003 and Eoin Colfer; visible Dutch front confirms title. Distinct from first Artemis Fowl whose Noordhoff language remains open.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p30302089X"],"reference":"work:2665","checked_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00.000Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-022.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL5725961W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p30302089X"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"68fc8a333d06103df9ee2fb1e73b71f2a49c11f48686e48c5f97e16be4a4c4f1","cover_id":8738097,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-003.json","limitation":"Artemis Fowl Eeuwige code Dutch title visible; unlike uncertain English Noordhoff part1 cover, this is a Dutch candidate."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL5725961W","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-003","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":946300171},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":987202012},"seq":25,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"paperback","work_id":987102008,"evidence":[{"note":"Exact Dutch ISBN9789047500469 matches Artemis Fowl The eternity code2003 and Eoin Colfer; visible Dutch front confirms title. Distinct from first Artemis Fowl whose Noordhoff language remains open.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p30302089X"],"reference":"work:2665","checked_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00.000Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-022.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL5725961W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p30302089X"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"68fc8a333d06103df9ee2fb1e73b71f2a49c11f48686e48c5f97e16be4a4c4f1","cover_id":8738097,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-003.json","limitation":"Artemis Fowl Eeuwige code Dutch title visible; unlike uncertain English Noordhoff part1 cover, this is a Dutch candidate."}],"cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/8738097-L.jpg?default=false","edition_id":987202012,"bound_title":"De Eeuwige Code","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789047500469","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p30302089X","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-003","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/8738097-M.jpg?default=false","bound_author_id":946300171},"before_row":null},{"key":{"id":987102015},"seq":26,"relation":"works","after_row":{"id":987102015,"title":"Aru Shah And The End Of Time","cover_id":null,"author_id":987302007,"work_type":null,"source_type":null,"open_library_id":"OL17875641W","first_publish_year":2018,"native_identity_key":"nlscale:fixture003:3415"},"before_row":{"id":987102015,"title":"Aru Shah And The End Of Time","cover_id":null,"author_id":987302007,"work_type":null,"source_type":null,"open_library_id":"OL17875641W","first_publish_year":2017,"native_identity_key":"nlscale:fixture003:3415"}},{"key":{"work_id":987102015,"language":"nl"},"seq":27,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Aru Shah brengt haar vakantie door in het museum waar haar moeder werkt. Tegenover klasgenoten verzint ze graag een indrukwekkender leven. Wanneer drie van hen haar uitdagen te bewijzen dat een oude lamp vervloekt is, steekt ze die aan. Daarmee bevrijdt ze een demon en raken haar moeder en de bezoekers in de tijd bevroren. Aru moet op zoek naar de herboren Pandava''s uit het Indiase heldenverhaal de Mahabharata. Haar behoefte erbij te horen maakt zo plaats voor een opdracht die de hele wereld raakt.","work_id":987102015,"evidence":[{"note":"Exact Dutch ISBN9789000364503 is the prose novel by Roshani Chokshi, not2022 graphic adaptation or a Rick Riordan-authored novel. Primary publisher releases27March2018, correcting current2017.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p418651442"],"reference":"work:3415","checked_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00.000Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-024.json","sources":["https://books.disney.com/book/aru-shah-end-time/","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL17875641W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p418651442"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"802b10dbf6aeb4580c1ccdb1b9776fc3b0eb3334cb933969eba8aa4505e58141","cover_id":8738205,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-003.json","limitation":"Front and source-edition binding; no barcode or exact-printing-year assertion."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://books.disney.com/book/aru-shah-end-time/","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-003","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":987302007},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":987202019},"seq":28,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"paperback","work_id":987102015,"evidence":[{"note":"Exact Dutch ISBN9789000364503 is the prose novel by Roshani Chokshi, not2022 graphic adaptation or a Rick Riordan-authored novel. Primary publisher releases27March2018, correcting current2017.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p418651442"],"reference":"work:3415","checked_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00.000Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-024.json","sources":["https://books.disney.com/book/aru-shah-end-time/","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL17875641W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p418651442"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"802b10dbf6aeb4580c1ccdb1b9776fc3b0eb3334cb933969eba8aa4505e58141","cover_id":8738205,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-003.json","limitation":"Front and source-edition binding; no barcode or exact-printing-year assertion."}],"cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/8738205-L.jpg?default=false","edition_id":987202019,"bound_title":"Aru Shah en het einde van de tijd","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789000364503","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p418651442","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-003","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/8738205-M.jpg?default=false","bound_author_id":987302007},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":987102009,"language":"nl"},"seq":29,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"In Richmond wordt medisch onderzoeker Kay Scarpetta betrokken bij een reeks moorden. Het onderzoek vraagt om nauwkeurige analyse van de lichamen en het beschikbare sporenmateriaal. Tegelijk moet zij omgaan met tegenwerking die niet uitsluitend van buiten de opsporing komt. Terwijl het aantal slachtoffers groeit, neemt ook de druk op haar werk toe. De zoektocht naar de dader wordt daardoor een gevecht om betrouwbare conclusies te trekken in een omgeving waarin niet iedereen belang heeft bij het boven water komen van de waarheid.","work_id":987102009,"evidence":[{"note":"Exact Dutch ISBN9789024513345 identifies Postmortem1990, not All That Remains. Preserve existing edition3131 and primary Patricia Cornwell identity.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p114513007","http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p166133388"],"reference":"work:2972","checked_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00.000Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-022.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL134383W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p114513007","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p166133388"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"a559448d6c9894e4fd1c8b5554b8c0d97257c879b18a443b31b9dfa0d1180f4f","cover_id":13730412,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-003.json","limitation":"Front and source-edition binding; no barcode or exact-printing-year assertion."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL134383W","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-003","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":987302005},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":987202013},"seq":30,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"paperback","work_id":987102009,"evidence":[{"note":"Exact Dutch ISBN9789024513345 identifies Postmortem1990, not All That Remains. Preserve existing edition3131 and primary Patricia Cornwell identity.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p114513007","http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p166133388"],"reference":"work:2972","checked_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00.000Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-022.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL134383W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p114513007","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p166133388"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"a559448d6c9894e4fd1c8b5554b8c0d97257c879b18a443b31b9dfa0d1180f4f","cover_id":13730412,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-003.json","limitation":"Front and source-edition binding; no barcode or exact-printing-year assertion."}],"cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/13730412-L.jpg?default=false","edition_id":987202013,"bound_title":"Fataal Weekend","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789024513345","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p114513007","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-003","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/13730412-M.jpg?default=false","bound_author_id":987302005},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":987102011,"language":"nl"},"seq":31,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Twee jaar na de dood van haar man begint Lisey Landon zijn werkkamer op te ruimen. Scott was een succesvol schrijver en zijn ongepubliceerde werk trekt nog steeds belangstelling. Wanneer iemand haar bedreigt om de papieren in handen te krijgen, weigert ze toe te geven. Het opruimen en de dreiging brengen tegelijk herinneringen terug die zij tijdens hun huwelijk op afstand heeft gehouden. Lisey moet opnieuw begrijpen wat zij van Scott wist en welke betekenis zijn verleden voor haar eigen veiligheid heeft.","work_id":987102011,"evidence":[{"note":"Exact Dutch ISBN9789024557745 identifies Lisey''s story2006, Stephen King and full novel, not derivative adaptation.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p297667599"],"reference":"work:3281","checked_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00.000Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-022.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL81589W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p297667599"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"8d69f74ddc673db8acef8e58eeb1f747ef17f9a50d557948ec5eea4684284591","cover_id":13675825,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-003.json","limitation":"Front and source-edition binding; no barcode or exact-printing-year assertion."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL81589W","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-003","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":928300049},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":987202015},"seq":32,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"paperback","work_id":987102011,"evidence":[{"note":"Exact Dutch ISBN9789024557745 identifies Lisey''s story2006, Stephen King and full novel, not derivative adaptation.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p297667599"],"reference":"work:3281","checked_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00.000Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-022.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL81589W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p297667599"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"8d69f74ddc673db8acef8e58eeb1f747ef17f9a50d557948ec5eea4684284591","cover_id":13675825,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-003.json","limitation":"Front and source-edition binding; no barcode or exact-printing-year assertion."}],"cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/13675825-L.jpg?default=false","edition_id":987202015,"bound_title":"Lisey''s verhaal","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789024557745","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p297667599","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-003","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/13675825-M.jpg?default=false","bound_author_id":928300049},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":987102007,"language":"nl"},"seq":33,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Bastiaan raakt verdiept in een geheimzinnig boek over Fantásië. Hij volgt de opdracht van Atréjoe, die het rijk en de Kleine Keizerin moet helpen redden. Gaandeweg merkt Bastiaan dat hij niet slechts van buitenaf naar het verhaal kijkt: ook zijn eigen rol krijgt betekenis. Wanneer hij zelf in Fantásië terechtkomt, worden zijn verlangens verbonden met de mogelijkheden van die wereld. Wat eerst een ontsnapping leek, stelt hem voor de vraag hoe hij zijn weg terug kan vinden.","work_id":987102007,"evidence":[{"note":"Reuse existing Dutch edition2810 ISBN9789021828237. Front title/Michael Ende match; public-library stamp on lower illustration is a quality limitation, not a borrower record or proof of a different book.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p416801609","http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p822507102","http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p843935529"],"reference":"work:2651","checked_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00.000Z","canonical_name_resolution":"Michael Andreas Helmuth Ende in exact ISBN/KB records is the canonical full name of existing Michael Ende, same original Die unendliche Geschichte1979 and source-author identity. No author record change or merge."},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-020.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL2271589W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p416801609","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p822507102","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p843935529"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"003b86dbbaab7b84466abf7ce01eb3e5bd54265f88ef0181cde1f5270f38c7ba","cover_id":9271483,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-003.json","limitation":"Title/Michael Ende visible, public-library ownership label overlays lower illustration. No borrower information or barcode-to-ISBN assertion."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL2271589W","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-003","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":987300004},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":987202011},"seq":34,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"hardcover","work_id":987102007,"evidence":[{"note":"Reuse existing Dutch edition2810 ISBN9789021828237. Front title/Michael Ende match; public-library stamp on lower illustration is a quality limitation, not a borrower record or proof of a different book.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p416801609","http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p822507102","http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p843935529"],"reference":"work:2651","checked_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00.000Z","canonical_name_resolution":"Michael Andreas Helmuth Ende in exact ISBN/KB records is the canonical full name of existing Michael Ende, same original Die unendliche Geschichte1979 and source-author identity. No author record change or merge."},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-020.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL2271589W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p416801609","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p822507102","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p843935529"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"003b86dbbaab7b84466abf7ce01eb3e5bd54265f88ef0181cde1f5270f38c7ba","cover_id":9271483,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-003.json","limitation":"Title/Michael Ende visible, public-library ownership label overlays lower illustration. No borrower information or barcode-to-ISBN assertion."}],"cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/9271483-L.jpg?default=false","edition_id":987202011,"bound_title":"Het oneindige verhaal","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789021828237","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p416801609","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-003","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/9271483-M.jpg?default=false","bound_author_id":987300004},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":987102004,"language":"nl"},"seq":35,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Bill Bryson verkent het menselijk lichaam vanuit vragen over wat het doet, hoe het zichzelf in stand houdt en waar het kwetsbaar is. Hij verbindt uitleg over lichamelijke processen met anekdotes en wetenschappelijke bevindingen. Daarmee maakt hij zichtbaar hoeveel er gebeurt zonder dat we er bewust bij stilstaan. Het boek is een tocht door de werking van het lichaam en door de pogingen om die te begrijpen. Verwondering vormt het vertrekpunt, zonder dat het een medische handleiding wordt.","work_id":987102004,"evidence":[{"note":"Exact ISBN primary bibliographic metadata and bookseller independently identify Dutch paperback31August2020, Bill Bryson, Atlas Contact. Missing KB result is not missing evidence after this check. Existing edition2607 retained; no medical claims or automatic taste eligibility.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://metadata.isbn.nl/1201565/het-lichaam.html","https://www.heinen.nl/a/bill-bryson/het-lichaam/500228019"],"reference":"work:2386","checked_at":"2026-11-02T17:01:00.000Z","c